# La Trobe University

> La Trobe University is a globally recognised Australian university with a strong reputation for academic excellence, world-class research, and deep community engagement. With campuses across Melbourne, regional Victoria & Sydney, La Trobe offers undergraduate, postgraduate, and research degrees to a diverse student body.

## Study Options

- [Undergraduate Courses](https://www.latrobe.edu.au/courses/undergraduate): Explore bachelor's degree programs in health, science, education, business, and more.
- [Postgraduate Courses](https://www.latrobe.edu.au/courses/postgraduate): Information on master's degrees, graduate diplomas, and certificates.
- [Research Degrees](https://www.latrobe.edu.au/research/graduate-research): Pathways to PhDs and research opportunities.

