## Faculties and Schools

- [La Trobe Business School](https://www.latrobe.edu.au/business): Courses in commerce, management, marketing, and analytics.
- [School of Allied Health, Human Services and Sport](https://www.latrobe.edu.au/health): Allied health, physiotherapy, occupational therapy, and sport.
- [School of Computing, Engineering and Mathematical Sciences](https://www.latrobe.edu.au/computing): Information technology, cybersecurity, and engineering disciplines.
- [School of Humanities and Social Sciences](https://www.latrobe.edu.au/humanities): Politics, languages, history, sociology, and philosophy.

